  "content": "\n\n<h1>傳送槍模組</h1>\n<p>為 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a> 重新實作 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fportal-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">iPortalTeam 的傳送槍模組</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://s2.loli.net/2023/03/19/mxdDAr76Y3RwV9B.png\" alt=\"portal_gun.png\" width=\"300\"></p>\n<h3>需求</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgeckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-portals-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Portals (適用於 Forge)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>合成配方</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://s2.loli.net/2023/03/19/qz5fNVnZCgytJUX.png\" alt=\"portal_gun_recipe.png\" width=\"200\"></p>\n<h3>鳴謝</h3>\n<p>感謝 <a href=\"https://github.com/iPortalTeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">iPortalTeam</a> 創建原始模組，以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Thelnfamous1/PortalGun/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thelnfamous1</a> 完成 1.19.2 Forge 版本移植。</p>",
